e": "2560 1440.png", "id": "1077341404090196", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540508_1077341407423529_4511965539534469614_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xMsTfcD8P7cQ7kNvwGQ8RdJ&_nc_oc=AdrtoQKhdySaHHFTLzXH2_SapybsIkEnVMnWA3lO08wPTt8k99Ztt1PkPc9fjQK21aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9Q8gJTMfXlag6W46Bs3P3PrR-8lRjEeyODbe_KkdM0Q&oe=6B08468B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fU6uTLyR3OYQ7kNvwEjP68j&_nc_oc=AdoqhT1jdG9lE3Ja1QJUfbuofeQUbGcjYl4ydVtB23bCZjAaDwUX9Ec0mApTkb2pbfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSRuCeyGT_kH-WgDdN9EZ4dDsGWqwTOvLYYN2PS_KwPQ&oe=6B087249"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc